# ===== Keil MDK 编译中间产物（体积最大，必须忽略）=====
*.o
*.crf
*.d
*.dep
*.lst
*.htm
*.build_log.htm
*.lnp
*.axf
*.bin
*.hex
*.map
*.ilk
*.exp

# ===== Keil 个人配置与 GUI 状态（每人电脑不同，不要共享）=====
*.uvoptx
*.uvguix.*
*.bak
*.orig

# ===== 调试与日志 =====
*.log
*.log.lock
*.scvd
*.dbgconf
DebugConfig/

# ===== VSCode（保留智能提示配置）=====
.vscode/*
!.vscode/c_cpp_properties.json

# ===== 大体积非源码文件（超过GitHub限制或无需版本控制）=====
*.avi
*.mp4
*.mov
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.tar
*.gz

# ===== 第三方软件工具（串口助手/烧录器/虚拟串口等，需要时重新下载）=====
*.exe
*.msi
*.apk
*.appimage
*.deb
*.rpm

# ===== 编译输出目录 =====
Objects/
Listings/
Output/
build/
dist/

# ===== 系统垃圾 =====
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
~$*
*.tmp
*.temp

# ===== MATLAB 临时文件 =====
*.asv
*.autosave
slprj/
sfprj/
